**Given:**

frac{{18 times 4 div 2 of 3 - 4}}{{2 times ( {9 - 7} ) + 1 - 2 times 3 div 4 of (1)/(2)}}

**Concept:**

Follow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:

 [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/bf30f37945dd983713c79f4e75972597226df7b829d8603182b9eed448249aba.png] 

**Calculation:**

frac{{18 times 4 div 2 of 3 - 4}}{{2 times ( {9 - 7} ) + 1 - 2 times 3 div 4 of (1)/(2)}}

⇒ frac{{18 times 4 div 2times 3 - 4}}{{2 ×2+ 1 - 2 times 3 div 4times (1)/(2)}}

⇒ {{18×4times{1over6}}-4}over{4+1-2×3times{1over2}} 

⇒ (12-4)over(5-3)

⇒ 8over2 = 4

**∴ The correct answer is 4.**
